<title>USA: Emory University, Ga., $70 mln repriced, ylds cut.</title>
<headline>Emory University, Ga., $70 mln repriced, ylds cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Tuesday it repriced Private Colleges and Universities Authority, Ga., $70 million bond deal for Emory University, cutting yields in several maturities while leaving the top yield unchanged at 5.45 pct in 2027.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>PRIVATE COLLEGES AND UNIVERSITIES AUTHORITY</p>
<p>GEORIGA TAX-EXEMPT FIXED RATE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>RE: $70,045,000*</p>
<p>SERIES 1997A (EMORY UNIVERSITY PROJECT)</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES</p>
<p>OF DTC</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE REPRICING.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aa1		   S&amp;P: AA</p>
<p>    DATED: 07/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 11/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 11/01</p>
